 :tcb/scope
 "Every file in `src/`. This repository IS the decision plane (root
  ADR-2608219500), so `code whose compromise can grant authority` is not a
  subset of it -- it is all of it. The inventory is therefore complete rather
  than curated, and `grant.tcb/validate` fails if a file in `src/` has no
  entry. A curated list would have to be argued about every time a namespace
  is added; a complete one only has to be regenerated, and the check says so
  when it was not."

